<title>USA: National Securities to buy banking firm.</title>
<headline>National Securities to buy banking firm.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Securities Corp said it began negotiations toward buying the institutional investment banking firm L.H. Friend, Weinress, Frankson &amp; Presson Inc.</p>
<p>The acquisition, subject to successful negotiation of a definitive agreement and NASD approval, would be accomplished through National's recently formed parent and holding company, Olympic Cascade Holding Corp.</p>
